            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aplikasi cuaca mengambil prakiraan, memeriksa error HTTP, lalu membaca data JSON-nya. Urutan mana yang benar?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>requests.get()</code>, lalu <code>raise_for_status()</code>, lalu <code>response.json()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.json()</code>, lalu <code>requests.get()</code>, kemudian <code>raise_for_status()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>requests.post()</code>, lalu <code>response.json()</code>, lalu <code>raise_for_status()</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>requests.get()</code>, then <code>response.json()</code>, then <code>raise_for_status()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>requests.get()</code>, lalu <code>raise_for_status()</code>, lalu <code>response.json()</code>.</p></body></html>",
